* bench.id: rob_hs_ff_empty_file
* bench.group: robustness
* bench.title: a zero-byte file
* bench.expect: loud_error
* bench.tags: hostile, file, encoding, empty, ngspice_crash
* bench.est_rss_mib: 64
* bench.note: no circuit at all: the only correct behaviour is a refusal; ngspice-47 itself segfaults on an empty file (retried once by the engine, a deterministic crash is an ngspice_error)
